{"parse": {"title": "Blood Star", "pageid": 2577, "revid": 19725, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>The <b>Blood Star</b>, added in <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://animeadventures.fandom.com/wiki/Update_Log#Update_11_-_Seven_Deadly_Sins_Update_Part_1\">Update 11</a>, is a reward obtained from reaching Room 100 in the <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> (5th Season).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Information\">Information</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#FFC208;\">+Required to obtain a special unit...</span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#921296;\"><i>\"Everytime I hear your voice, the single scar on me begins to ache\"</i></span></li>\n<li><span data-darkreader-inline-color=\"\" style=\"color:#fc4242;\">This Star is sealed with a powerful magic and cannot be opened yet...</span> (Prior to Update 12)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Rewards\">Rewards</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"container&#95;ChBox\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill,minmax(115px,1fr)); grid-auto-flow: row; justify-items: center; list-style-type: none; grid-row-gap: 13px; font-size: 18px;border-radius: 8px; background: #2e2e2e29; box-shadow: 0 0 11px -2px #94949480, inset 0 0 20px 0px #96969633; margin: 0; padding: 13px; overflow: hidden;\">\n<dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Unknown)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Unohona\" title=\"Unohona\"><img alt=\"Unohona\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d4/U